    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/inference> ;
    rdfs:label "competesWith is irreflexive"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:competesWith is irreflexive: a rival standpoint claim never competes with itself, as its skos:definition states. gmeow:competesWith is symmetric (owl:SymmetricProperty) but irreflexive; irreflexivity is enforced here on the canonical carrier — kept out of OWL to hold the reasoned profile within OWL 2 DL (the deception discipline) — and the native coherence gate raises a violation for a claim asserted to compete with itself; the generated SHACL constraint surface is its projection."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:competesWith ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:competesWith ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:competesWith never relates a subject to itself; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a self-edge is meaningful — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:competesWith, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:competesWithIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:competesWith ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .
gmeow:inferencePremiseConclusionDistinctness
    a owl:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:RelatumDistinctnessAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/inference> ;
    rdfs:label "an inference commitment's premise and conclusion are distinct"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts that a gmeow:InferenceCommitment's gmeow:premise and gmeow:conclusion must be distinct: an argument cannot assume what it proves — no premise is also the conclusion. The native coherence gate raises a violation when a premise coincides with the conclusion; the generated SHACL constraint surface is its projection."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:distinctnessTarget gmeow:InferenceCommitment ;
    logic:distinctnessRole gmeow:premise , gmeow:conclusion ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:premise ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce this record's integrity condition over gmeow:InferenceCommitment; the record is the canonical carrier the gate joins."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when gmeow:InferenceCommitment no longer bears the condition — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read the record's own logic: fields together: they name gmeow:InferenceCommitment and the condition asserted over it, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching axiom from them."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:inferencePremiseConclusionDistinctness logic:characterizes gmeow:InferenceCommitment ."@x-gmeow-english ;
